[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9181.349, "timestamp": "02:33:01", "text": "词汇表呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9184.55, "timestamp": "02:33:04", "text": "哦，是的。所以，是的，当我……的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9186.15, "timestamp": "02:33:06", "text": "聊聊室友之类的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9188.309, "timestamp": "02:33:08", "text": "当时我就像在参观小溪一样。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9190.469, "timestamp": "02:33:10", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9192.23, "timestamp": "02:33:12", "text": "你和室友相处得怎么样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9193.99, "timestamp": "02:33:13", "text": "一切都结束了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9196.79, "timestamp": "02:33:16", "text": "你知道，这很可怕，就像……如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9199.11, "timestamp": "02:33:19", "text": "如果我喜欢，就把虚拟主播部分留下来吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9200.95, "timestamp": "02:33:20", "text": "我只是个普通人。是的，我很喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9202.95, "timestamp": "02:33:22", "text": "我和室友之间有很多事情，而且总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9205.91, "timestamp": "02:33:25", "text": "乐趣。但说到喜欢和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9207.91, "timestamp": "02:33:27", "text": "直播，是的，那些家伙就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9211.63, "timestamp": "02:33:31", "text": "实在太麻烦了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9215.429, "timestamp": "02:33:35", "text": "啊，他们根本不给你隐私。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9217.27, "timestamp": "02:33:37", "text": "呃，问题是他们会说，“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9220.309, "timestamp": "02:33:40", "text": "好的。好吧，兄弟。但后来……发生了一些事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9222.71, "timestamp": "02:33:42", "text": "呃，就像，比如说，像这样进来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9225.75, "timestamp": "02:33:45", "text": "一些家庭争吵，或者可能是你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9227.79, "timestamp": "02:33:47", "text": "了解一段对话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9230.309, "timestamp": "02:33:50", "text": "突然。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9232.15, "timestamp": "02:33:52", "text": "所以，是的，你无法控制它们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9233.15, "timestamp": "02:33:53",